# What a formatter must never rewrite.
#
# The `format` script already scopes itself to `src/`; this is the second half,
# so that a bare `prettier --write .` typed by hand cannot reach any of it.

# Records. `docs/sprints/`, `docs/decisions/` and `docs/audits/` say what was
# true when they were written and are never edited to match the present
# (CLAUDE.md rule 83). Reflowing their Markdown would rewrite them wholesale in
# a diff nobody could read, for no reading benefit.
docs/

# Generated by the Workflow compiler on every build, not authored here.
src/app/.well-known/workflow/

# Generated from the database schema by `pnpm db:types`. Formatting it would
# make the next regeneration a diff.
src/types/database.ts

# Build output, caches and tool state.
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/
supabase/.temp/
.claude/
node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml
next-env.d.ts
